"<strong>Types&nbsp;->&nbsp;Manage Types</strong>, click on the "
"<strong>Import</strong> button, select the macro file(s) you want to import, "
"and you're done."
msgstr ""
"Instalirajte makro samo za korisnika koji je instaliran: u Kig, odaberi  "
"<strong>Types&nbsp;->&nbsp;Manage Types</strong>,kliknite na <strong>Import</"
"strong> dugme, odaberi makro datoteku(e) koje  želite da uvezete, i gotovi "
"ste."

#: contrib/kig/index.php:20
msgid "Global installation"
msgstr "Globalne instalacije"

#: contrib/kig/index.php:21
msgid ""
