"that machine: place it in <span style=\"font-family:monospace;\">&#36;KDEDIR/"
"share/apps/kig/builtin-macros/</span>. The new macro(s) will be available in "
"Kig the next time you start Kig."
msgstr ""
"To zahtijeva korijenske privilegije! Instalirajte makro za svaku Kig "
"korisnika na toj mašini: stavite ga u <span style=\"font-family:monospace;"
"\">&#36;KDEDIR/share/apps/kig/builtin-macros/</span>. Nova makro(i) će biti "
"dostupan(i) u KIG sljedeći put kada pokrenete KIG."

