#~ msgid ""
#~ "Educational topics are discussed on <a href=\"http://forum.kde.org"
#~ "\">forum.kde.org</a> in the forum\n"
#~ "<a href=\"http://forum.kde.org/viewforum.php?f=21\">Games, Education "
#~ "&amp; Utilities</a>."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Edukacijske teme i rasprave na <a href=\"http://forum.kde.org\">forum.kde."
#~ "org</a> i forumu\n"
#~ "<a href=\"http://forum.kde.org/viewforum.php?f=21\">Games, Education "
#~ "&amp; Utilities</a>."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The learning files listed here are intended for use with %1, %2, and %3 "
#~ "which are both part of the KDE Edutainment project. The files can also be "
#~ "used with %4, a program that was included in earlier versions of KDE. To "
#~ "some extent these files also work with %5 and %6."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Nastavne datoteka ovdje navede su namijenjene za korištenje s %1, %2, i "
#~ "%3 koji su i dio projekta KDE Edutainment. Datoteke se mogu također "
#~ "koristiti s %4, program koji je bio uključen u starijim verzijama KDE. U "
#~ "određenoj mjeri datotekeće  također raditi s %5 i %6."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "KVocTrain is similar in that aspect but adds some complexity. Create and "
#~ "edit kvtml file using %1."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "KVocTrain je sličan u tom pogledu, ali dodaje neke složenosti. Stvaranje "
#~ "i uređivanje kvtml datoteke pomoću %1."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If you are on KDE4 already consider using %1. Parley offers a wealth of "
#~ "editing possibilities without being as difficult to master as KVocTrain."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ako ste na KDE4 već uzeti u obzir pomoću %1. Piratski nudi bogate "
#~ "mogućnosti uređivanja bez da se tako teško svlada kao KVocTrain."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Despite the fact that all files can be loaded and used with both "
#~ "KWordQuiz and KVocTrain you should keep in mind that KWordQuiz has a "
#~ "simpler design and might ignore some features from the files. If you work "
#~ "with KWordQuiz and save afterwards you might lose some properties that "
#~ "are available in KVocTrain. For that reason the table above lists "
#~ "advanced features that are only available in KVocTrain. Minor features "
#~ "like the names of lessons are not mentioned though they get lost with "
#~ "KWordQuiz. It is expected that this limitation will be removed in the "
#~ "next major version of KDE."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Uprkos činjenici da se sve datoteke mogu učitati i koristiti s obje "
#~ "KWordQuiz i KVocTrain trebate imati na umu da KWordQuiz ima jednostavniji "
#~ "dizajn i može ignorirati neke funkcije iz datoteka. Ako radite sa "
#~ "KWordQuiz i snimite nakon toga možete izgubiti neke osobine koje su "
#~ "dostupne u KVocTrain. Iz tog razloga u tabeli navodimo listu naprednih "
#~ "funkcija koje su dostupne samo u KVocTrain. Minor karakteristike kao što "
#~ "su imena lekcija se ne spominju iako su se izgubili sa KWordQuiz. Očekuje "
#~ "se da će se ova ograničenja uklonjeniti u narednim glavnim verzijama KDEa."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<b>Important note for KVocTrain users:</b> When changing the sources to "
#~ "be more compatible with the\n"
#~ "   XML standards I broke compatibility with older executables and did not "
#~ "notice. If your KVocTrain application reports <tt>Error in line 2</tt> "
#~ "you only have to load this file with a simple text editor and change in "
#~ "line 2 lowercase <tt>system</tt> and <tt>doctype</tt> to uppercase "
#~ "<tt>SYSTEM</tt> and <tt>DOCTYPE</tt>. As an alternative you may as well "
#~ "download the recent version from KDE CVS."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<b>Važna napomena za korisnike KVocTrain:</b>  Kad mijenjanje izvora koji "
#~ "treba da bude kompatibilan sa\n"
#~ "   XML standardima oštetio sam kompatibilnost sa starijim izvršnim "
#~ "programima i nisam priijmetio. Ako vaša KVocTrain aplikacija prijavi "
#~ "<tt>Greška u liniji  2</tt>vi samo trebate učitati ovu datoteku s "
#~ "jednostavnim tekst editorom i mijenjati u linij 2 mala slova <tt>system</"
#~ "tt> and <tt>doctype</tt> u velika slova <tt>SYSTEM</tt> and <tt>DOCTYPE</"
#~ "tt>. Kao alternativu možete i preuzeti nedavne verziju sa KDE CVS."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<b>Removing Grades:</b> Using KVocTrain you should be able to remove "
#~ "grades from the files by pressing the left mouse button over the table "
#~ "header of the translation (second column) and select \"Reset Grades\"."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<b>Uklanjanje ocjena:</b> Koristeći KVocTrain ti bi trebao biti u "
#~ "mogućnosti da uklonilš ocjene iz datoteke pritiskom na lijevu tipku miša "
#~ "preko stola zaglavlja prijevoda (druga kolona) i odaberite \"Reset ocjena"
#~ "\"."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Please keep in mind when using data from books or similar: copyright\n"
#~ "  violation. As a rule of thumb you might say that individual word "
#~ "translations can be used from\n"
#~ "  books but not entire sections (The data isn't copyrighted but the "
#~ "collection of data is). Also\n"
#~ "  books out of copyright can be used for data (in the US this means "
#~ "mainly pre-1923 books). Have a\n"
#~ "  look at project Gutenberg at <a href='http://gutenberg.spiegel."
#~ "de/'>Projekt Gutenberg-DE</a>\n"
#~ "  (deutsche Webseite), or <a href='http://www.gutenberg.org/'>www."
#~ "gutenberg.org</a> (English site),\n"
#~ "  for more information about finding out if a book is out of\n"
#~ "  copyright."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Imajte na umu kada se koriste podaci iz knjige ili slično: autorska "
#~ "prava\n"
#~ "  kršenje. Kao pravilo moglo bi se reći da se pojedini prevodi riječ se "
#~ "mogu koristiti od\n"
#~ "  knjiga, ali ne i cijelog područja (podaci nisu autorskim pravima, ali "
#~ "prikupljanje podataka). takođe\n"
#~ "  knjige bez autorskih prava mogu se koristiti za podatke (u SAD-u to "
#~ "znači uglavnom za knjige prije1923). Pogledajte\n"
#~ "  projekt Gutenberg na <a href='http://gutenberg.spiegel.de/'>Projekt "
#~ "Gutenberg-DE</a>\n"
#~ "(njemačka stranica), ili <a href='http://www.gutenberg.org/'>www."
#~ "gutenberg.org</a> (engleska stranica),\n"
#~ "Za više informacija o pronalaženju da li je knjiga bez\n"
#~ "autorska prava."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Download the <a href=\"http://websvn.kde.org/*checkout*/trunk/KDE/kdeedu/"
#~ "parley/themes/theme_reference.svgz\">theme_reference.svgz</a>. \n"
#~ "Once you have opened it you will find a tutorial how to proceed."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Preuzmite <a href=\"http://websvn.kde.org/*checkout*/trunk/KDE/kdeedu/"
#~ "parley/themes/theme_reference.svgz\">theme_reference.svgz</a>. \n"
#~ " Nakon što ste otvorili tu ćete naći tutorial kako da nastavte."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p><strong>KLettres</strong> is an application specially designed to help "
#~ "the user to learn alphabet in a new language and then to learn to read "
#~ "simple syllables. The user can be a young child aged from two and a half "
#~ "or an adult that wants to learn the basics of a foreign language.</"
#~ "p><p>There are twenty languages available at the moment: Arabic, Czech, "
#~ "Brazilian Portuguese, British English, Danish, Dutch, English, French, "
#~ "German, Hebrew, Hungarian, Italian, Kannada, Low Saxon, Luganda, "
#~ "Malayalam, Romanized Hindi, Spanish, Slovak and Telugu.</p>"
#~ msgstr ""
